{"step_index":939,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T23:28:18Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-12T01:28:18+02:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-12T01:28:18+02:00\nFile Path: `file:///mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9/Challenge_e20263a9.lean`\nTotal Lines: 353\nTotal Bytes: 13918\nShowing lines 330 to 353\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n330:     have h0 := h_no0 v\n331:     omega\n332:   have h_sum : ∑ v : V, 1 ≤ ∑ v : V, (f v : ℕ) :=\n333:     Finset.sum_le_sum (fun v _ => h_ge1 v)\n334:   rw [Finset.sum_const, nsmul_eq_mul, mul_one] at h_sum\n335:   rw [Finset.card_univ] at h_sum\n336:   exact h_sum\n337: \n338: lemma mem_ballWithin_one_of_adj {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n339:     (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (c u : V) (hadj : G.Adj c u) :\n340:     u ∈ ballWithin G 1 c :=\n341:   mem_ballWithin_of_walk G (SimpleGraph.Walk.cons hadj SimpleGraph.Walk.nil)\n342: \n343: lemma mem_ballWithin_one_self {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n344:     (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (c : V) :\n345:     c ∈ ballWithin G 1 c :=\n346:   ballWithin_subset_succ G 0 c (Finset.mem_singleton_self c)\n347: \n348: theorem prove_e20263a9 : Candidate := by\n349:   sorry\n350: \n351: theorem refute_e20263a9 : ¬ Candidate := by\n352:   sorry\n353: \nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
